{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unify Medieval Japan in this real-time tactical grand strategy game. Build your domain, recruit armies, plan your attack, and fracture your enemies with rebellions to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034170/extras/timelapse.gif?t=1738407807\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Build</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Building improvements allow you to increase your wealth, recruit new units, defend your territory, and reduce unrest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034170/extras/BuildingUI.gif?t=1738407807\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Plan</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Pause the game at any time to plan coordinated attacks with your armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034170/extras/PlanningAttack.gif?t=1738407807\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Conquer</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Conduct real-time tactical assaults\u00a0with your armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034170/extras/attack.gif?t=1738407807\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Survive</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Fight off internal rebellions threatening your domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034170/extras/rebellion.gif?t=1738407807\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Dominate</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Conquer all territories to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034170/extras/mapwon.gif?t